:[{"type":"main","q":"What is the passage mainly about?","qz":"","o":["The meaning, food and customs of the Mid-Autumn Festival.","How to make ice cream mooncakes.","The life of the poet Li Bai.","How spacecraft land on the moon."],"a":0,"e":"全文介绍中秋节的含义、月饼、传说和各地习俗。"},{"type":"detail","q":"Why do families try to get together on this day?","qz":"","o":["Because the full moon is a symbol of reunion.","Because schools close for a month.","Because they must make lanterns together.","Because it is the first day of the new year."],"a":0,"e":"第二段：a full moon is a symbol of reunion（圆月象征团圆）。"},{"type":"vocab","q":"\"People who are far from home often feel homesick.\" \"Homesick\" means ____.","qz":"","o":["sad because you miss your home","ill because of bad food","happy to travel","tired after work"],"a":0,"e":"homesick = 想家的。远离家乡的人常常想家，李白的诗也写了这种心情。"},{"type":"infer","q":"Why did China probably name its moon program \"Chang'e\"?","qz":"","o":["Because Chang'e is connected with the moon in a famous old story.","Because Chang'e was a famous scientist.","Because Chang'e built the first rocket.","Because Chang'e invented mooncakes."],"a":0,"e":"传说中嫦娥飞到了月亮上，所以用她的名字命名探月工程很合适。"},{"type":"tf","q":"All mooncakes have the same filling.","qz":"","o":["True","False"],"a":1,"e":"第三段：传统馅料有豆沙、莲蓉、坚果等，现在还有冰激凌、巧克力、咖啡等新口味。"}]}